ASSISTANT ```
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ...mirroring exactly what `pkey.rs` does with `OpensslPrivateKeyIdentityWrapper`. Its `Value` would be a newtype around `String` (the passphrase) that implements `Exportable` by returning the passphrase bytes.
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ---
