ASSISTANT     identity_type: IdentityType,       // the secret to export (reuse existing)
ASSISTANT     credential_key_id: String,         // symmetric key used to encrypt
ASSISTANT     credential_key_derivation: String,
ASSISTANT     credential_iterations: u32,
ASSISTANT     output_file: String,
ASSISTANT     nix_crypto_args: NixCryptoArgs,
ASSISTANT }
ASSISTANT ```
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT And the function:
