ASSISTANT ---
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ### 3. Serialization of `AsymmetricEncryptionResult`
ASSISTANT Implement `IsCryptoStoreKey`'s `to_store_value_raw` / `from_store_value_raw` to serialize/deserialize the struct. The two fields (encrypted key blob, IV+ciphertext) can be stored as a simple length-prefixed binary format.
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ---
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ### 4. Implement `export_encrypted`
ASSISTANT Call `crypto_nix.get_or_derive(&AsymmetricEncryptionKey { ... })` to get or compute the `AsymmetricEncryptionResult`, then:
ASSISTANT - PEM-encode the encrypted symmetric key blob with label `"ENCRYPTED KEY"`.
ASSISTANT - PEM-encode the IV-prepended ciphertext with label `"ENCRYPTED DATA"`.
ASSISTANT - Concatenate and return as a `String`.
